    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i cant find the bottle anywhere and my doctors office is closed so i cant call anyone rn. she's totally miserable. she's about 55 lbs if that helps? can u just tell me how much of the liquid tylenol to give her so she can sleep? i dont want to keep her up all night with this fever",
